# `minecraft:add_entity` (clientbound play 1) as a real 26.1.2 server sent it.
#
# Source: `target/vanilla-capture/bodies-lit/000139_s2c_play_1.bin`, captured from a vanilla 26.1.2 dedicated
# server through the rig in `tools/surface-capture/`. The capture directory is not tracked, so the bytes are
# copied here with their provenance rather than referenced.
#
# It is 52 bytes, which is the sum of the field widths the packet's shape implies:
#   VarInt entity id (1) + UUID (16) + VarInt type id (1) + 3 x f64 (24) + 3 x i8 (3) + VarInt data (1) + 3 x i16 (6)
# The entity is a slime: the type id is 0x75 = 117, and `entity_types.tsv` says 117 = minecraft:slime.
#
# Format: lowercase hex, whitespace ignored.
4e 24 28 91 34 98 3d 4d d0 88 a1 e8 61 9b 33 e3 5e 75 40 48 08 08 da 00 61 90 c0 4d c0 9d 41 f6 27 90 40 34 cf 2b c5 81 db 83 01 f3 79 58 a0 45 00 6d 6d 00
